{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_adr_0003_image_in_string_out_failures_are_exceptions", "label": "ADR 0003: Image in, string out, every failure an exception", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/adr/0003-image-in-string-out-failures-are-exceptions.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "adr_id": "0003", "status": "Accepted", "date": "2026-08-19"}, {"id": "docs_adr_0003_image_in_string_out_failures_are_exceptions_minimal_api_contract", "label": "Minimal API contract: image in, string out, failures are exceptions", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/adr/0003-image-in-string-out-failures-are-exceptions.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "No result objects, status codes or None returns (rejected by name in spec section 1 without argument). There is no channel for partial success: anything the library will not vouch for, it raises on. describe() is sugar for Describer(**opts).describe(image, ...)."}, {"id": "docs_adr_0003_image_in_string_out_failures_are_exceptions_exception_hierarchy", "label": "DescribeItError exception hierarchy", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/adr/0003-image-in-string-out-failures-are-exceptions.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Shaped by what a caller would do about the failure, not where it arose. One base so 'except DescribeItError' catches everything the library raises. OllamaTimeoutError is a sibling of OllamaConnectionError, not a subclass, because a timeout usually means 'model is slow', not 'server is down'. Wrapped originals are chained via raise ... from."}, {"id": "docs_adr_0003_image_in_string_out_failures_are_exceptions_caller_mistakes_standard_types", "label": "Caller mistakes raise TypeError/ValueError, never DescribeItError", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/adr/0003-image-in-string-out-failures-are-exceptions.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A non-image argument raises plain TypeError (the standard Python contract). Out-of-range options (max_words < 1, timeout <= 0, blank host/model, max_image_size <= 0, prompt='') raise ValueError at construction; non-int or bool max_words/max_image_size raise TypeError. Keeps 'except DescribeItError' from swallowing bugs in calling code."}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_adr_0003_image_in_string_out_failures_are_exceptions", "target": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_08_19_describe_it_design", "relation": "cites", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/adr/0003-image-in-string-out-failures-are-exceptions.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_adr_0003_image_in_string_out_failures_are_exceptions", "target": "docs_adr_0003_image_in_string_out_failures_are_exceptions_minimal_api_contract", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/adr/0003-image-in-string-out-failures-are-exceptions.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_adr_0003_image_in_string_out_failures_are_exceptions", "target": "docs_adr_0003_image_in_string_out_failures_are_exceptions_exception_hierarchy", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/adr/0003-image-in-string-out-failures-are-exceptions.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_adr_0003_image_in_string_out_failures_are_exceptions", "target": "docs_adr_0003_image_in_string_out_failures_are_exceptions_caller_mistakes_standard_types", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/adr/0003-image-in-string-out-failures-are-exceptions.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_adr_0003_image_in_string_